# These services run on Linux. A CRLF in a shell script or an entrypoint is a
# "bad interpreter" error there, and nothing on a Windows machine will show it
# before the container fails. Normalise on commit rather than trusting every
# contributor's core.autocrlf.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.db binary
